ction class="visit_game"><h2>Play game</h2><a class="button fat play_btn" href="https://weltmaschine.itch.io/chaotic-tests">[ksg]Chaotic Tests Quattro&#039;s itch.io page<svg class="svgicon icon_arrow_up_right" version="1.1" width="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" role="img" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden height="24"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a></section><section class="jam_comment_form"><h2>Leave a comment</h2><p class="form_placeholder"><a href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" data-register_action="comment">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p></section><section id="comments" class="jam_comment_list"><h2>Comments</h2><div id="community_topic_posts_7553561" class="community_topic_posts_widget base_widget"><div id="community_post_list_7132668" class="community_post_list_widget base_widget"><div class="community_post sidebar_avatar has_replies" id="post-16995905" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:17132060,&quot;id&quot;:16995905}"><div id="first-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/viprpgfes-supporter"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2NzAwNjgxLnBuZw==/80x80%23/vF%2BTPE.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/viprpgfes-supporter">viprpgfes_supporter</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-slug="host">Host</span><a href="/jam/viprpg-summer-2026/rate/4954636"><span class="author_flag">Submitted</span></a><span title="2026-08-11 12:52:38" class="post_date"><a href="/post/16995905">70 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>No problem, gentle man. We are enjoying the your game although a little problem!</p><p>Welcome our game-jam! And&nbsp;I&#x27;m sorry for my poor supports.</p><p>A volunteer reported the your game&nbsp; included&nbsp;several character codes. Please Check the character codes of&nbsp; the&nbsp;file names. (Off course, I can&#x27;t say for sure...)</p><p>Last but not least, this game-jam is hold for enjoying! There is no need for regrets!<br></p></div><div class="related_submission"><a href="/jam/viprpg-summer-2026/rate/4954636"><div id="lazy_image_7116067" class="lazy_image_widget base_widget"></div></a><div class="submission_summary"><div class="sub">Submitted</div><a href="/jam/viprpg-summer-2026/rate/4954636">ふぃなーれ！2026夏</a></div></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action vote_btn" href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" data-register_action="community_vote"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies top_level_replies"><div class="community_post is_reply" id="post-17038931" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:18560097,&quot;id&quot;:17038931}"><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/weltmaschine"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5Mzk3OTgzLnBuZw==/25x25%23/K5Lr6N.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/weltmaschine">世界機械</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-slug="developer">Developer</span><span title="2026-08-16 16:42:47" class="post_date"><a href="/post/17038931">65 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>Sorry for absent in recent days www ( I was busying in moving to Netherland for university)<br>I asked some of my friend and ChatGPT for help on character coding issues and trying to fix it, but however I could not find a definite way to eliminate or test the issues (I tried to use&nbsp;LocaleEmulator for testing and it seemed to be okay...)<br></p><p>Thanks for the support! I really enjoyed the gamejam and VIPRPG!</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action vote_btn" href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" data-register_action="community_vote"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post sidebar_avatar" id="post-16975257" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:18560097,&quot;id&quot;:16975257}"><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/weltmaschine"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5Mzk3OTgzLnBuZw==/80x80%23/Ot91ig.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/weltmaschine">世界機械</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-slug="developer">Developer</span><span title="2026-08-09 09:30:30" class="post_date"><a href="/post/16975257">72 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>I am really sorry for this</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action vote_btn" href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" data-register_action="community_vote"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post sidebar_avatar" id="post-16975232" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:18560097,&quot;id&quot;:16975232}"><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/weltmaschine"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5Mzk3OTgzLnBuZw==/80x80%23/Ot91ig.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/weltmaschine">世界機械</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-slug="developer">Developer</span><span title="2026-08-09 09:27:22" class="post_date"><a href="/post/16975232">72 days ago</a></span> <span class="edit_message">(1 edit)</span> <span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>Please forgive me, I would like to do anything for it，(´；ω；｀)</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action vote_btn" href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" data-register_action="community_vote"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post sidebar_avatar has_replies" id="post-16975208" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:18560097,&quot;id&quot;:16975208}"><div id="last-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/weltmaschine"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5Mzk3OTgzLnBuZw==/80x80%23/Ot91ig.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/weltmaschine">世界機械</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-slug="developer">Developer</span><span title="2026-08-09 09:24:20" class="post_date"><a href="/post/16975208">72 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>Oh damn I uploaded wrong files in the Summer Vacation  of VIPRPG</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action vote_btn" href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" data-register_action="community_vote"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" class="post_action reply_btn" data-register_action="community_reply">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies top_level_replies"><div class="community_post is_reply" id="post-16975212" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:18560097,&quot;id&quot;:16975212}"><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/weltmaschine"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5Mzk3OTgzLnBuZw==/25x25%23/K5Lr6N.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/weltmaschine">世界機械</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-slug="developer">Developer</span><span title="2026-08-09 09:25:13" class="post_date"><a href="/post/16975212">72 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>I am really sorry aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa<br>I had a version for the&nbsp;Summer Vacation of VIPRPG and another version for my another tk but I missed up the zip</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action vote_btn" href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4871992" data-register_action="community_vote"><span class="icon-like"></span><span cl